{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tomb of Chacal is a stealth-based horror game set in an long-forgotten tomb. You are an archeologist who has stumbled into this place almost by accident and are now in a fight for your very survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">YOU ARE NOT ALONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/extras/Tomb_of_Chacal_monsters_A.gif?t=1748770359\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dead do not want to be disturbed and there are ancient creatures called &quot;Guardians&quot; that have been sworn to protect this place from all who would trespass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PUZZLES AND EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/extras/Tomb_of_Chacal_puzzles.gif?t=1748770359\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with different contraptions to make your way through the labyrinth. Collect artifacts to return to the museum - if you can make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DO NOT BE SEEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/extras/Tomb_of_Chacal_monsters_B.gif?t=1748770359\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The guardians here are not omniscient - you will have to use your wits to survive. Find hiding spots to confuse them, or just run away if all else fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687100?t=1748770359","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687100?t=1748770359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687100/0d27e11f